      ":question/id": "a63399e4-e82c-5af9-98c0-96ca44ad61b9",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -8 & 18 \\\\ 3 & -7 & 42\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form using the standard algorithm for Gaussian elimination, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -8 & 18 \\\\ 3 & -7 & 42\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -4 & 9 \\\\ 3 & -7 & 42\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -4 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 15\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -4 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
